content":"（愣了一下）好像……是有点像。在家里，我一做错事，那种距离感就出来了，我总得花好久才能把它补回来。原来我一直是这么活的。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575015905651135,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":5,"sort":5},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af673f7f4429d1fd72f74bc","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536439632,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673f2f4429d1fd72f74b4","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你描述的那个画面——眼神冷下来、说话变客气、慢慢隔开——听起来很具体，像是你亲眼见过它发生。这种“隔了一层就回不去”的感觉，是不是和从小怕父母失望时那种距离感有点像？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你描述的那个画面——眼神冷下来、说话变客气、慢慢隔开——听起来很具体，像是你亲眼见过它发生。这种“隔了一层就回不去”的感觉，是不是和从小怕父母失望时那种距离感有点像？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2143,"promptTokens":3278,"completionTokens":115,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:34"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008576546126719646,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af673f2f4429d1fd72f74b3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536434539,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673f2f4429d1fd72f74b3","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"（沉默几秒）就是……眼神会冷下来，说话变得客气，然后慢慢疏远。我最怕的是那种“隔了一层”的感觉，好像我再怎么努力，都回不去了。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008576546126719646,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af673f2f4429d1fd72f74b4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536434536,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673eef4429d1fd72f74ac","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你怕的好像不只是我觉得你有问题，而是知道全部之后，我对你的态度会变，会离你远一点。这种“被看见就会失去”的担心，听着挺让人心疼的。那在你心里，我“变了”会是什么样子？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你怕的好像不只是我觉得你有问题，而是知道全部之后，我对你的态度会变，会离你远一点。这种“被看见就会失去”的担心，听着挺让人心疼的。那在你心里，我“变了”会是什么样子？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2117,"promptTokens":2593,"completionTokens":111,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:30"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008575369287707468,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af673eef4429d1fd72f74ab","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536430619,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673eef4429d1fd72f74ab","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"挺强的，大概……七八分吧。不过你没说我有问题，我心里好像稍微轻了一点点。只是我还是会想，你知道全部以后，会不会就变了。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008575369287707468,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":4,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":3,"sort":2},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af673eef4429d1fd72f74ac","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536430616,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673eaf4429d1fd72f74a5","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你说出来后松了口气，又马上后悔，怕我因此觉得你有问题——这份怕很真实，也很能理解。可我听下来，只觉得你一个人扛了很久。现在这份“怕我觉得你不好”的感觉，有多强烈？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你说出来后松了口气，又马上后悔，怕我因此觉得你有问题——这份怕很真实，也很能理解。可我听下来，只觉得你一个人扛了很久。现在这份“怕我觉得你不好”的感觉，有多强烈？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2004,"promptTokens":2601,"completionTokens":87,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:26"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01406113902269069,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af673eaf4429d1fd72f74a4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536426351,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:20:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af673eaf4429d1fd72f74a4","chatId":"1e84352fe4b94800b920ec53fd9445a8","sessionId":null,"userId":99836,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"说出来了……好像松了口气，可又更怕了。心里空落落的，我甚至有点后悔，怕你觉得我这个人有问题。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips